      "content": "(stave, -s, stave, -z) stave | stick; cane; club or clublike weapon; staff (MED s.v. staf n.) | clearly some sort of packing unit for copper pans, but meaning unknown | clearly some sort of packing unit (measure?) of kettles, but exact meaning unknown | stave for making crossbows | probably the bow of a cross-bow | staves for a bill, which is an obsolete military weapon used chiefly by infantry; varying in form from a simple concave blade with a long wooden handle, to a kind of concave axe with a spike at the back and its shaft terminating in a spear-head; a halberd (OED s.v. bill n.1 2) | stave for spears"
    }
